# AgriN Project Rules

- **Security & Architecture:**
  - The Gemini API key MUST be kept server-side only (within Firebase Functions).
  - NO frontend AI API calls are allowed. All AI features must be routed through the backend.
  - Authentication must be validated before allowing any Gemini API calls.

- **Stack:**
  - Frontend: React + Vite + TypeScript.
  - Backend: Firebase (Functions, Firestore, Storage).
